{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22254","headline":"过骆山人野居小池 · 白居易","name":"过骆山人野居小池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅覆环堵亭，泉添方丈沼。\n红芳照水荷，白颈观鱼鸟。\n拳石苔苍翠，尺波烟杳渺。\n但问有意无，勿论池大小。\n门前车马路，奔走无昏晓。\n名利驱人心，贤愚同扰扰。\n善哉骆处士，安置身心了。\n何乃独多君，丘园居者少。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}